I know that you know that I know…

eventually becomes unconstrained storytelling.

The stronger strategy is not “we know better.”

It’s:

design moves that remain good across several plausible models of what the other side knows.

That’s robust strategy.

In Pantheon language:

Don’t win the mind-reading contest. Reduce how much mind-reading the move requires.

